   "offered_by": {
    "allegiance": "codex/emperors_children/allegiances/allegiance_emperors_children"
   },
   "text": "Requirements\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 unit with the Daemon special rule.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Inductii unit.\n- Your army must include either a Daemon Prince or Keeper of Secrets.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field the following units from Codex – Renegades & Heretics in your Primary Detachment:\n    - Cultist Mob.\n    - Slaangors.\n- You may field the following units from Codex – Chaos Daemons in your Primary Detachment:\n    - Daemonettes.\n    - Herald of Slaanesh.\n    - Seekers of Slaanesh.\n    - Seeker Chariot.\n    - Hellflayer Chariot.\n    - Keeper of Secrets.\n- Any Emperor's Children unit with the Character special rule may purchase Combat Drugs (see Wargear) for 10pts.",
   "restrictions": [
    {
     "id": "daemon_unit",
     "printed": "Your army must include at least 1 unit with the Daemon special rule.",
     "scope": "detachment",
     "units": {
